/Title (keeping memory use nearly constant as the file grows. It validates the number of fields and parses amounts with Decimal, so paise values are accepted. Specific validation failures are recorded with line numbers instead of being silently discarded. A blank final line is safely ignored. Therefore, a 50,000-line file can be processed reliably without holding the entire file or report in memory.)
