/Title (Replacing the specific handlers with except Exception: pass and introducing a misspelled variable \(for example, writing presnt += 1 instead of present += 1\) causes a NameError. Because NameError is an Exception subclass, the bare handler catches it and silently ignores it. The program may finish with an incorrect count and no diagnostic. This is dangerous because programming defects become indistinguishable from bad input.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1252 0 R
